OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FExtensive low cloud and fog is
OL,6,Fexpected inland during the morning,
OL,7,Flikely slow to clear many places. Some
OL,8,Feventual hazy sunny spells should
OL,9,Ffollow into the afternoon, with
OL,10,Fintermittent, mostly light rain
OL,11,Farriving in the far south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FGradually becoming cloudy and
OL,14,Fwet during the evening, with a swathe
OL,15,Fof rain moving very slowly northwards
OL,16,Fbefore stalling over the region, with
OL,17,Fsome heavier spells possible in the
OL,18,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
