OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA damp start with some
OL,6,Fheavier spells of rain in the south.
OL,7,FBoth the cloud and the rain will fade,
OL,8,Fleaving some late sunny spells for
OL,9,Fmany. Temperatures near normal.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FBreezy at first Thursday, but becoming
OL,13,Fdrier and eventually brighter into the
OL,14,Fweekend as temperatures fall away,
OL,15,Fwith overnight frosts developing
OL,16,Fwidely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
